&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;October 31 brings us &lt;strong&gt;Halloween&lt;/strong&gt;, followed immediately by &lt;strong&gt;Día de los Muertos&lt;/strong&gt; on November 1 and 2—a sacred time when the barrier between the living and the spirit realm is said to dissolve.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In Mexican tradition, a…&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class="gh-btn-container"&gt;&lt;a class="gh-btn" href="https://github.com/ath1614/OfrendaViva-AI" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;View on GitHub&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
